  <item>
    <title>Vol.61 还原建筑师林徽因的大女主人生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678883eab21f1c0fb33e8232</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678883eab21f1c0fb33e8232</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 16 Jan 2025 04:18:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>多年来，包括主播在内的世人皆以浪漫言情、传奇佳话中的女主人公来看待、讲述林徽因先生的传奇故事，忽略了作为职业建筑师的林徽因的学术价值与历史意义，因此我们试图在纷纷扰扰的传言中，还原林先生独特的人格魅力</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：小菲，岳指</span></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">02:08</a> 自己的房间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a> 福建林家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="593">09:53</a> 赴欧旅行痴迷建筑学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="765">12:45</a> 徐志摩的老婆孩子热炕头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="866">14:26</a> 大丈夫难免妻不贤子不孝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1100">18:20</a> 需自我克制的洛丽塔情结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1352">22:32</a> 天空的蔚蓝，爱上了大地的碧绿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1477">24:37</a> 引领梁思成进入建筑学领域</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1520">25:20</a> 最强旁听生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">27:10</a> 纷纷扰扰的1925年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1755">29:15</a> 务要痛改前非，重新做人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2217">36:57</a> 回国第一站，东北大学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2342">39:02</a> 营造学社与太太的客厅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2481">41:21</a> 徐志摩坠机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2702">45:02</a> 老婆是自己的好，文章是老婆的好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2741">45:41</a> 日记公案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2926">48:46</a> 终于有了自己房间的凌叔华</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3066">51:06</a> 唐风只在日本？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3189">53:09</a> 不信谣不传谣，咱们还辟谣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3399">56:39</a> 梁上美人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3417">56:57</a> 佛光寺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3536">58:56</a> 南渡北归</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3602">60:02</a> 一寸山河一寸血</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3833">63:53</a> 跑警报</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4037">67:17</a> 地图上找不到的地方——李庄</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4151">69:11</a> 中国建筑史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4284">71:24</a> 现代住宅设计</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4396">73:16</a> 创建清华营建学系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4452">74:12</a> 1948年的一天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4488">74:48</a> 梁陈方案与苏联专家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4591">76:31</a> 拆城墙，推牌楼，一片欣欣向荣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4775">79:35</a> 夕阳无限好，只是近黄昏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4870">81:10</a> 天地人，小霸王其乐无穷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4957">82:37</a> 最后的要求，想见见思成</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5030">83:50</a> 建筑师林徽因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5237">87:17</a> 林璎继承衣钵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5330">88:50</a> 就剩一句了</span></p>]]></description>
