    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>开幕式和圣火传递都是纳粹发明的，杀入奥运会绑架运动员的凶手被全球追杀，本国饭圈观众大喊退票，奥运会的阴暗面，我们拿出来晒晒</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：小菲，岳指</span></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 跳水解说厚此薄彼区别对待</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">02:02</a> 远动员养蛊粉丝反噬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="202">03:22</a> 乒乓球自作自受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="464">07:44</a> 营销，郑钦文是专业的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="583">09:43</a> 大熊猫本人都不知道的饭圈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="664">11:04</a> 樊振东惨遭开盒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="728">12:08</a> 真正的奥运精神被嘲讽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="914">15:14</a> 纳粹的宣传天才戈培尔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1370">22:50</a> 纳粹发明了开幕式和圣火传递</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1865">31:05</a> 朝鲜宣传片与俄罗斯导演</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2062">34:22</a> 奥运史上最黑暗的一幕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2164">36:04</a> 黑色九月</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2270">37:50</a> 奥运村劫持事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2397">39:57</a> 德国草台班子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2907">48:27</a> 愤怒的以色列与“上帝之怒”行动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3152">52:32</a> 利勒哈默尔的失败</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3481">58:01</a> 朴素爱国情感与难堪大任的掉杠王</span></p><span></span><p><span>Playlist：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Helena -- 《Summer Body》</span></p>]]></description>
