    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>既然奥运会是全人类的Party，那么打个扑克搓个麻将也是非常合理的</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：一姐，小菲，岳指</span></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="195">03:15</a> 奥运要表现的是先锋、当代的文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="245">04:05</a> 燃冬和戏梦巴黎，你要举报哪个？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="453">07:33</a> 你要死要活给谁看呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="558">09:18</a> 团体操后遗症</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="792">13:12</a> 文化暴露狂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1009">16:49</a> 小诸葛怒刷存在感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1152">19:12</a> 非要出奇，但没有志胜儿，不绝美</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1396">23:16</a> 养狼计划大丰收</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1586">26:26</a> 国粹曲线挺进奥运</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1692">28:12</a> 麻将打得是一个自信</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1775">29:35</a> “滚子”是大连人的中医和传武</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2087">34:47</a> 规则永远由强者来制定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2153">35:53</a> 打滚子的父辈与驾校教练</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2447">40:47</a> 冲宝儿是对命运的掌控</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2508">41:48</a> 颜值解放是自由的第一枪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2932">48:52</a> 男运动员闯进女子项目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3102">51:42</a> 给大连老爷们儿刻板一下</span></p><span></span><p><span>Playlist：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Namewee Ft. Meu Ninomiya -- 《Tokyo Bon​》</span></p>]]></description>
