  <item>
    <title>Vol.55 夏日限定一夜暴富之寻宝大作战</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a9164c33ddcbb53c35a4f8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a9164c33ddcbb53c35a4f8</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 31 Jul 2024 02:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>夏天是一个做白日梦的季节，让我们跟随合理冲撞的航线，去一夜暴富吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：小菲，岳指</span></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="96">01:36</a> 神秘嘉宾小A大婚，祝百年好合</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="350">05:50</a> 摇滚黑彩，岳指底线日渐模糊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="454">07:34</a> 强运出击，出门不捡就算丢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="559">09:19</a> 拾金不昧的抢劫团伙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="846">14:06</a> 金属探测器与霍克森宝藏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1162">19:22</a> 经常结婚的朋友都知道晚上当然是讨论抛尸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1501">25:01</a> 倒退三十年，岳指马上带你到达现场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1817">30:17</a> 大开门儿的藏宝图</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1975">32:55</a> 失踪的北京人头骨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2239">37:19</a> 挖掘“山下宝藏”之可行性探究</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2644">44:04</a> 德川埋藏金，赶不上菲律宾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2921">48:41</a> 纳粹黄金列车营销案例</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3066">51:06</a> 思路打开，无购物挖宝团招募中</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3216">53:36</a> 灭口之难，甚于防川</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3313">55:13</a> 挖宝的知识储备</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3461">57:41</a> 民族情感爆棚的爱国主义寻宝战士</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3505">58:25</a> 从AA到小A，经费解决了</span></p><span></span><p><span>Playlist：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hiroshi Kitadani --《 We Are》</span></p>]]></description>
