    <title>Vol.53 世间多不公，以血引雷霆：记一次司法实践</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669647ce8fcadceb90b6f5da</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669647ce8fcadceb90b6f5da</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 16 Jul 2024 10:13:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>世间多不公，以血引雷霆？</span></p><span></span><p><span>邓大人说笑了，还是装好避雷针实际些</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目立意很简单，不开心的事情说出来让大家开心一下</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：小菲，岳指</span></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="61">01:01</a> 一条朋友圈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">02:08</a> 一通骗子电话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="261">04:21</a> 一口安徽口音</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="352">05:52</a> 拨打110</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="470">07:50</a> 诚挚道歉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a> 监控录像</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="714">11:54</a> 笔录</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> “应当知道”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="973">16:13</a> 前倨后恭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1085">18:05</a> 办成铁案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1145">19:05</a> 喜怒无常</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1177">19:37</a> 绕口令：我既不说接受你的道歉也不说不接受你的道歉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1430">23:50</a> 认定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1504">25:04</a> 谅解与放弃复议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1996">33:16</a> 下周三，出尔反尔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2325">38:45</a> 终于遇到一个好警察</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3640">60:40</a> 物业拿自己当管理者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4147">69:07</a> 铁晨</span></p><span></span><p><span>Playlist：</span></p><span></span><p><span>暴力香槟 -- 《两种该死的人》</span></p>]]></description>
